{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "That is it from us then! Ireland extend their dominance over Zimbabwe, staying unbeaten. This was probably the visitors' best chance to win a game on this tour but perhaps as they say, everyday is not Sunday and the final match is on a Sunday, so who knows... can Zimbabwe end the tour with a win? Join us on 14th July, 2019 at 4 pm local (1500 GMT) for the third and final T20I. ADIOS! TAKE CARE!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:52:01+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Earlier in the day, Zimbabwe started slowly but then rocketed to 132 in 13 overs, thanks to two rain delays. The 67-run stand between Ervine and Williams gave the Zimbabwe supporters something to cheer about but Paul Stirling quickly snatched it in the matter of an hour.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:50:33+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "A hapless bowling performance from Zimbabwe. No one, at any stage, looked in any sort of control as Stirling ate his lunch, breakfast and dinner in form of the Zimbabwe bowlers. Not a single bowler conceded below 10 runs an over and Ireland, through Stirling, just teed away. If you need to chase 134 in 13 overs, you need a special knock and Stirling's unbeaten 83 from 36 provided more than that. Courtesy that man, the home side chased down the target with 13 balls to spare!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:48:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "A helter-skelter of a win. That is what T20 is all about, isn't it? Or a T13, in this case. If Zimbabwe thought they had enough on the board, well, perhaps the board itself was short for Ireland.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:45:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,284,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "IRELAND WIN! What a victory. Stirling the man for them, pushes it towards long on with his arms aloft and completes the requisite run.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:42:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "2,67,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Outside off, Paul looks to hit this through the off side but the ball takes the inside edge and snakes through past the leg stump towards fine leg. A couple taken.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:41:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,341,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "SIX! CLUNK! This is connected well. A short ball, around off, Stirling waits and pulls it over mid-wicket for a biggie!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:41:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,34,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "DROPPED! No one can believe it. Short delivery from Jarvis, on middle stump, Balbirnie pulls but does not time it well. The ball goes straight to Mpofu at deep square leg who makes a mess of it and lets Balbirnie off the hook. A single taken.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:40:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "1,14,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Around middle, worked through square leg for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:39:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Kyle Jarvis is back on. 2-0-23-0 so far.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:39:10+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Full length delivery, on middle stump, a rare defense from Stirling. Plays it back to the bowler.", "Summary": {"Score": "122/1", "Over": "10", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4476", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "74", "Balls": "33", "Fours": "6", "Sixes": "6"}, {"Batsman": "4454", "Runs": "25", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3671", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "20", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:38:25+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,114,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "FOUR! Whoa! Off the top edge. Full and around off, Stirling gets down to paddle but the ball takes the top edge and rockets behind. Lobs high in the air and lands just inside the third man fence!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:38:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Good length delivery, on off stump, Stirling steers it to point but no run taken.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:37:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,163,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Outside off, slapped through the covers for one.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:36:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,284,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Around middle, chipped towards long on for a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:35:56+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,269,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, Balbirnie hits it back to the bowler who sticks out his right hand and deflects it towards mid-wicket. A run taken.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:35:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Chris Mpofu returns. 1-0-14-0 so far.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:34:46+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Bowler_Name": "Sikandar Raza", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Full length delivery, on middle stump. Balbirnie drives it to cover but there is no run available there.", "Summary": {"Score": "115/1", "Over": "9", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4476", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "69", "Balls": "29", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "6"}, {"Batsman": "4454", "Runs": "23", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "25422", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:34:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,346,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Bowler_Name": "Sikandar Raza", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Around middle and leg, worked through square leg for a run.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:33:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,10,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Bowler_Name": "Sikandar Raza", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Short ball, on middle stump, Stirling glances it towards deep mid-wicket for a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:33:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Bowler_Name": "Sikandar Raza", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "The batsman fails to put bat on ball.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:32:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,281,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Bowler_Name": "Sikandar Raza", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "SIX! This one has gone out of the ground. Full and outside off, Stirling gets down on a knee and slogs it over long on.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:32:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,12,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Bowler_Name": "Sikandar Raza", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "SIX! CLUBBED! Short ball, on leg stump, Stirling pulls it behind square leg for a massive six. Poor start from Raza.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:31:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Sikandar Raza introduced now.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:30:51+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3682", "Bowler_Name": "Sean Williams", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Outside off, Andy looks to cut but gets a bottom edge. Taylor leaps to collect.", "Summary": {"Score": "101/1", "Over": "8", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4454", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "22", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4476", "Runs": "56", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "4"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3682", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "23", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:30:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "2,74,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3682", "Bowler_Name": "Sean Williams", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "FOUR! Lapped away! Full and around off, Balbirnie gets down and paddles it to the fine leg fence.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:29:28+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,345,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3682", "Bowler_Name": "Sean Williams", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Around off, worked through mid-wicket for a run.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:29:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "4,151,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3682", "Bowler_Name": "Sean Williams", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "FOUR! Short and outside off, Stirling cuts it through point and finds the fence!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:28:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,346,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3682", "Bowler_Name": "Sean Williams", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "The batsman has played it towards mid-wicket. They pick up a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:28:01+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,302,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3682", "Bowler_Name": "Sean Williams", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Full and around off, pushed towards mid on for a quick single.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:27:44+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,15,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "FOUR! Punishment on the Free Hit. A length ball, on middle, Balbirnie whips it through mid-wicket and explores the boundary!", "Summary": {"Score": "90/1", "Over": "7", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4454", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "17", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4476", "Runs": "50", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "4"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4295", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "23", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:26:23+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "FREE HIT TIME!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:25:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "nb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "NO BALL! Jarvis oversteps, resulting in a no ball. Coming to the ball, it was short, outside off, Balbirnie tries to cut it but misses the ball.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:25:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "2,68,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "DROPPED! Costly miss. A length ball outside off, Balbirnie gets down and paddles it towards fine leg. Chris Mpofu runs back from short fine leg, puts in a jump but lands awkwardly and puts it down! Two runs taken.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:25:19+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,339,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "FOUR! Up and over mid-wicket! Good length delivery, on leg stump, Balbirnie slogs it towards deep mid-wicket for another boundary for Ireland.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:24:10+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,345,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "HALF CENTURY! 7th 50-plus score in his last 8 international innings. Full and down the leg side, flicked through square leg to bring up that milestone. What a player.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:23:14+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,284,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Short ball, on off stump, Balbirnie pulls it to long on for another single.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:22:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4295", "Bowler_Name": "Kyle Jarvis", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "A short ball outside off, Balbirnie looks to cut but gets a bottom edge which goes on the bounce to the keeper.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:21:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Kyle Jarvis is back on. 1-0-10-0 so far.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:21:36+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,163,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58070", "Bowler_Name": "Ryan Burl", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Full length delivery, on middle stump, Stirling defends it to the off side for a quick single.", "Summary": {"Score": "77/1", "Over": "6", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4454", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "6", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4476", "Runs": "49", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "4"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "58070", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:20:33+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,210,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58070", "Bowler_Name": "Ryan Burl", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "FOUR! Full and outside off, Balbirnie gets down and lofts it over cover for a boundary!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:19:51+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,210,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58070", "Bowler_Name": "Ryan Burl", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "Outside off, Stirling rocks back and cuts it to deep cover for a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:19:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,339,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58070", "Bowler_Name": "Ryan Burl", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "SIX! And another! Stirling is taking Ireland home single-handedly. This is on the pads, Paul gets forward and whips it massively over mid-wicket once more!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:18:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,342,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58070", "Bowler_Name": "Ryan Burl", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "SIX! CLOBBERED! Full and around off, Stirling gets down and sweeps it mightily over mid-wicket!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:18:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,24,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58070", "Bowler_Name": "Ryan Burl", "Batsman": "4454", "Batsman_Name": "Andy Balbirnie", "Commentary": "Full and around leg, swept behind square leg for a single.", "Timestamp"