 off, Stirling gets down on a knee and lofts it over mid off for half a dozen!", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:09:33+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,152,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "3773", "Batsman_Name": "Kevin O'Brien", "Commentary": "Outside off, carved to sweeper cover for a run.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:08:52+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,32,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "3773", "Batsman_Name": "Kevin O'Brien", "Commentary": "FOUR! Behind square leg! FOUR! Good length ball outside leg, Kevin O Brien makes room to the leg side and glances it towards deep square leg. The fine leg fielder runs behind it but the ball wins the race.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:08:22+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Third man comes up now.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:08:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,163,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3671", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Mpofu", "Batsman": "4476", "Batsman_Name": "Paul Stirling", "Commentary": "A length ball outside off, Stirling walks across and punches it through the covers for a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-07-12T18:07:41+00:00", "